  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mhp 103.01 Composition of the Board. The board shall consist of 9 members appointed by the governor and council and shall meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 330-A:3.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Mhp 100) #5675, eff 7-22-93, EXPIRED: 7-23-99\n\nNew. #7623, eff 1-10-02, EXPIRED: 1-10-10\n\nNew. #9852, eff 1-25-11, EXPIRED: 7-1-14\n\nNew. #11040, eff 2-24-16; ss by #13224, eff 6-30-21",
